      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The subtle markers for top-tier Western executive polish often involve demonstrating cultural fluency, which means navigating diverse social norms with grace, not just knowledge. This includes adeptly balancing assertiveness with diplomatic deference during cross-cultural negotiations. Furthermore, an elite candidate often exhibits an ability to pivot seamlessly between highly tactical problem-solving and expansive strategic vision within a short period. They possess the unspoken social calibration to command respect while actively building durable, multi-layered networks globally.",
      "source": "target",
